data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"posts\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"1972844067009705\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1463787901248660/permalink/1972844067009705/\",\n        \"text\": \"**Every coach has seen it.**\\n\\nA great hitter goes 0 for 3 and carries it into the next game. A pitcher walks one batter and the whole inning falls apart. The talent was never the problem. It’s the noise between the ears.\\n\\nAfter decades of working with players and teams, I wrote ***Just Win This Pitch!*** to help athletes handle those moments.\\n\\n***Just Win This Pitch! ***teaches players ages 15 and up eight practical mental game skills to *bounce back after mistakes, stay focused, and compete under pressure.* No lectures. No fluff. \\n\\nCoaches get a built-in guide with weekly plans, drills, team discussion questions, and game-day prompts. **It's a practical way to give your entire team a common mental game system before the season begins.**\\n\\nParents, these books are written for your player, too. **They're fun, easy-to-read guides with self-assessments and personal reflections that help athletes develop their own mental game plans.**\\n\\nCoach John Schaly, the winningest coach in NCAA Division II baseball history, put it this way: “The mental game is the great separator.”\\n\\nMore than 1,000 teams already use books from the* Play Like Champions* series to train mental game skills. \\n\\nThe offseason is the perfect time to develop these skills alongside hitting, pitching, and fielding. While many teams ignore the mental game, yours won't.\\n\\nBoth the baseball and fastpitch softball editions of *Just Win This Pitch! *are available on Amazon for anyone interested in learning more.\",\n        \"publishedAt\": \"2026-11-06T15:41:48.000Z\",\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"commentCount\": 1,\n        \"isPaidPartnership\": null,\n        \"sharedPostId\": null,\n        \"sharedPostUrl\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"id\": \"59100838\",\n          \"name\": \"Curt Ickes\",\n          \"url\": null\n        },\n        \"video\": {\n          \"thumbnailUrl\": null,\n          \"durationMs\": null,\n          \"sdUrl\": null,\n          \"hdUrl\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"1972822163678562\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1463787901248660/permalink/1972822163678562/\",\n        \"text\": \"Sunday, November 15th \\n10am to 3pm All Skills\\n3:30-5:30pm Pitchers & Catchers \\n\\nGreat line up of coaches to work with you.\\n\\nRegister at: \\nWww.diamondsinthedirt.com\",\n        \"publishedAt\": \"2026-11-06T15:15:06.000Z\",\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"commentCount\": 0,\n        \"isPaidPartnership\": null,\n        \"sharedPostId\": null,\n        \"sharedPostUrl\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"id\": \"100051590720954\",\n          \"name\": \"Jaime Wohlbach Catching\",\n          \"url\": null\n        },\n        \"video\": {\n          \"thumbnailUrl\": null,\n          \"durationMs\": null,\n          \"sdUrl\": null,\n          \"hdUrl\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"1972801807013931\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1463787901248660/permalink/1972801807013931/\",\n        \"text\": \"🚨🚨This camp is open to all players from all organizations in the grad years 2027 - 2031.  This camp is open to any and all entrants.  Limited only by number, age, grade level, and gender.  Register right away!  This camp will sell out! 🚨\\n\\nThis camp will take place on Saturday, November 7th 8:00-11:30am, in Anaheim, CA.  This prospect camp will have college coaches from the following schools in attendance: \\n\\nCal State Fullerton\\nCal State Northridge\\nUC San Diego\\nUC Riverside\\n\\nRegistration cost is $100 per athlete.  Registration closes on Friday, November 6th.  Make sure to register right away before this camp fills up and registration ends!\\n\\nWe will also be measuring the following metrics:\\nOverhand throwing velocity\\nUnderhand throwing velocity (Pitchers)\\nPop time (Catchers)\\nExit velocity (Batting)\\n20 yard sprint (baseline)\\n\\nFor more info or to register, please call or text 714-348-9760.\",\n        \"publishedAt\": \"2026-11-06T14:57:45.000Z\",\n        \"reactionCount\": 0,\n        \"commentCount\": 0,\n        \"isPaidPartnership\": null,\n        \"sharedPostId\": null,\n        \"sharedPostUrl\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"id\": \"pfbid02FsXtFSs1JcKCTi7dsL1TrmjSLv5jhFecZj4kAFdwYeXTmf1YSZSWcMr5Zwom93CSl\",\n          \"name\": \"Jeff Blanco\",\n          \"url\": null\n        },\n        \"video\": {\n          \"thumbnailUrl\": null,\n          \"durationMs\": null,\n          \"sdUrl\": null,\n          \"hdUrl\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"1972800987014013\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1463787901248660/permalink/1972800987014013/\",\n        \"text\": \"🥎 Get in front of college coaches this January at the U Next Sports Softball Prospect Camp!\\n\\nU Next Sports is proud to partner with **Windermere Wildfire – Ocala** to bring this college exposure camp to local athletes.\\n\\nWe’ve already helped athletes on their way to college softball commitments, and we’re excited to give more players the opportunity to showcase their skills in person, get evaluated by college coaches, and learn what to do next in their recruiting journey.\\n\\n**Eight schools are confirmed so far:**\\n\\n- Millennia Atlantic University\\n- New College of Florida\\n- Keiser University\\n- Florida National University\\n- John Melvin University\\n- College of Central Florida\\n- Graceland University- Iowa\\n- Trinity College of Florida \\n\\nWe’ll share more schools as they confirm attendance - they are still joining \\n\\n📅 **January 10, 2027 • 9 AM–1 PM**  \\n🥎 **Ages 14+ • $100 early bird registration**  \\n📍 **Trinity Catholic High School**  \\n2600 SW 42nd St, Ocala, FL 34471\\n\\n**Bringing five or more players from the same team?** Text Coach Monica at **352-216-3920** for team discount details and payment options.\\n\\n**Register today at [www.UNextsports.com](https://www.UNextsports.com).**\",\n        \"publishedAt\": \"2026-11-06T14:56:52.000Z\",\n        \"reactionCount\": 2,\n        \"commentCount\": 0,\n        \"isPaidPartnership\": null,\n        \"sharedPostId\": null,\n        \"sharedPostUrl\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"id\": \"pfbid02c5Mhk5AkiCiMjsAR8cT6K6AYEyHh2Fnwjq29imbdFLQnv6N6a98vyMs51BfcTugel\",\n          \"name\": \"Monica De La Cruz\",\n          \"url\": null\n        },\n        \"video\": {\n          \"thumbnailUrl\": null,\n          \"durationMs\": null,\n          \"sdUrl\": null,\n          \"hdUrl\": null\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"page\": {\n      \"nextCursor\": \"AQHTAh5QM8VsfTA6BduVGjT9H0OgLLv9IR9q6bXJIlgua9rVr1UqHeIkf4IKaU6vX2OyW3nLI-bcGnxvK31-M6huDA:eyIwIjoxNzkzOTgxOTQ4LCIxIjo3NjgyLCIzIjoxLCI0IjoxLCI1IjoyLCI2IjotMSwiNyI6LTEsIjgiOi0xfQ==\",\n      \"hasMore\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_61db145b-5ba2-487b-8191-682089956860\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"conversation_id\":\"01a1b1a8-1f05-7807-bfcf-b7cdf98dbc16\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"data":{"lookupStatus":"found","posts":[{"id":"1972844067009705","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1463787901248660/permalink/1972844067009705/","text":"**Every coach has seen it.**\n\nA great hitter goes 0 for 3 and carries it into the next game. A pitcher walks one batter and the whole inning falls apart. The talent was never the problem. It’s the noise between the ears.\n\nAfter decades of working with players and teams, I wrote ***Just Win This Pitch!*** to help athletes handle those moments.\n\n***Just Win This Pitch! ***teaches players ages 15 and up eight practical mental game skills to *bounce back after mistakes, stay focused, and compete under pressure.* No lectures. No fluff. \n\nCoaches get a built-in guide with weekly plans, drills, team discussion questions, and game-day prompts. **It's a practical way to give your entire team a common mental game system before the season begins.**\n\nParents, these books are written for your player, too. **They're fun, easy-to-read guides with self-assessments and personal reflections that help athletes develop their own mental game plans.**\n\nCoach John Schaly, the winningest coach in NCAA Division II baseball history, put it this way: “The mental game is the great separator.”\n\nMore than 1,000 teams already use books from the* Play Like Champions* series to train mental game skills. \n\nThe offseason is the perfect time to develop these skills alongside hitting, pitching, and fielding. While many teams ignore the mental game, yours won't.\n\nBoth the baseball and fastpitch softball editions of *Just Win This Pitch! *are available on Amazon for anyone interested in learning more.","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T15:41:48.000Z","reactionCount":2,"commentCount":1,"isPaidPartnership":null,"sharedPostId":null,"sharedPostUrl":null,"author":{"id":"59100838","name":"Curt Ickes","url":null},"video":{"thumbnailUrl":null,"durationMs":null,"sdUrl":null,"hdUrl":null}},{"id":"1972822163678562","url":"https://www.facebook.com/groups/1463787901248660/permalink/1972822163678562/","text":"Sunday, November 15th \n10am to 3pm All Skills\n3:30-5:30pm Pitchers & Catchers \n\nGreat line up of coaches to work with you.\n\nRegister at: \nWww.diamondsinthedirt.com","publishedAt":"2026-11-06T15:15:06.000Z","reactionCount":2,"commentCount":0,"isPaidPartnership":null,"sharedPostId":null,"sharedPostUrl":null,"author":{"id":"100051590720954","name":"Jaime Wohlbach Catching","url":null},"video":{"thumbnailUrl":null,"durationMs":null,"sdUrl":null,"hdUrl":null}},{"id":"1972801807013931","url":"https:/